{"root":"fantasi","ipa":"/fan.ta.si/","core":"幻想、想象、虚构的事物","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/fan.ta.si/","zh":"幻想，指不受现实约束的想象力或虚构的意象。","phrases":[{"t":"fantasi liar","zh":"狂野的幻想"},{"t":"dunia fantasi","zh":"幻想世界"},{"t":"daya fantasi","zh":"想象力"}],"examples":[{"t":"Cerita itu penuh dengan fantasi yang luar biasa.","zh":"那个故事充满了非凡的幻想。"},{"t":"Jangan biarkan fantasi mengaburkan kenyataan.","zh":"不要让幻想模糊了现实。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"fantasi","ipa":"/fan.ta.si/","zh":"幻想","phrase":{"t":"fantasi anak-anak","zh":"儿童的幻想"},"example":{"t":"Dia hidup dalam dunia fantasi.","zh":"他生活在幻想世界里。"}},{"w":"berfantasi","ipa":"/bər.fan.ta.si/","zh":"幻想（动词），进行幻想","phrase":{"t":"suka berfantasi","zh":"喜欢幻想"},"example":{"t":"Dia sering berfantasi tentang masa depannya.","zh":"他经常对自己的未来进行幻想。"}},{"w":"memfantasikan","ipa":"/məm.fan.ta.si.kan/","zh":"将某事幻想为，使……成为幻想","phrase":{"t":"memfantasikan sesuatu","zh":"将某事幻想化"},"example":{"t":"Penulis itu memfantasikan kehidupan di planet lain.","zh":"那位作家将外星生活进行了幻想化描写。"}}],"derSlugs":["fantasi","berfantasi","memfantasikan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:26:35.883Z","src":"base"}